cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite the associated article and this archive."
title: "PHy-CPP: physics-informed hybrid ML for impact resistance of carbonate natural building stones — code and data"
abstract: >-
  Code and dataset for a physics-informed hybrid model (Extra Trees + IS-gated sigmoid blend +
  dual Gauss-gated compensatory prediction) that predicts the impact resistance (BS EN 14158) of
  carbonate natural building stones under leakage-free nested Leave-One-Group-Out cross-validation.
